  "title" : "IMOS Ships of Opportunity Underway Data from AIMS Vessel RV Solander Trip 5114 From 26 Jun 2010 To 30 Jun 2010",
  "description" : "'Ships of Opportunity' (SOOP) is a facility of the Australian 'Integrated Marine Observing System' (IMOS) project. This data set was collected by the SOOP sub-facility 'Sensors on Tropical Research Vessels' aboard the RV Solander Trip 5114.",
